[en.DOCTRINE_ARMY_1_0_FLAME_OF_RAGE]
Flame of Rage

[en.DOCTRINE_ARMY_1_0_FLAME_OF_RAGE_DESC]
The impact of magic and artillery on warfare is revolutionary. When you take away the lives of your enemies, you no longer need to look into their eyes. They will embrace death from above before they even realize the battle has begun.

[en.DOCTRINE_ARMY_1_0_FLAME_OF_RAGE_desc]


[zh.DOCTRINE_ARMY_1_0_FLAME_OF_RAGE]
怒火倾泻

[zh.DOCTRINE_ARMY_1_0_FLAME_OF_RAGE_DESC]
魔法与火炮对于战争的影响是革命性的，索取对方性命之时，你不再需要注视着他们的双眼。他们将在甚至意识到交战开始之前，就拥抱从天而降的死亡。

[zh.DOCTRINE_ARMY_1_0_FLAME_OF_RAGE_desc]
